WEBVTT

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.160
Where in the world is this?

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:09.410
Hanzou-san.

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:14.710
I'm not quite sure how to say this, but I want to understand you more, Hanzou-san.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:19.090
Then I think I could make the proper contract as a general.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.840
Hanzou-san...?

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.130
What's wrong?

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.850
I'll teach you what the proper contract is like.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:33.270
Wait, Hanzou-san! What's with you?

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.610
Matabei-san, I want you to listen, too.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:39.860
I want to understand you two-

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.150
Matabei-san?

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.950
You too, Hanzou-san?

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.330
H-Hey, what's wrong with you two?!

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.000
Kanetsugu?!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.120
No way.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.160
Why?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.710
You don't have to understand.

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:59.170
You don't have to know how we feel.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.340
Come now, forget all of it.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:06.800
Be honest with yourself and drown in pleasure.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.760
Pleasure...

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:10.180
Yes.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.600
How is it?

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:14.430
Doesn't it feel good?

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:23.280
He fell.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:11.010
By my general's orders, I will execute you.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.590
I have a request.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:15.810
You're going to plead for you life now?

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:19.680
How rude! Yukimura-sama would never-

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.560
Tell me. Is Muneakira safe?

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:25.400
What?

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.940
Is Muneakira alive?

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:32.660
How noble; caring about your master even when death is looming near.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.740
Please, tell me!

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:37.080
Yukimura-sama...

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:40.960
Is my general safe? Is Muneakira alive?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:44.630
That's all I want. Please, tell me!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.040
He isn't dead.

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:50.300
Then Jyuubei-san too?

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.300
Is Ohii-sama... Is Senhime-sama safe?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:58.060
Don't worry. My general will not kill those three so easily.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.230
Muneakira and the rest are okay, then.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.270
Thank goodness...

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:05.730
You have my gratitude as a samurai, D'Artagnan.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.070
Now that I know everyone's safe, then...

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:14.240
Hold the phone! Then what?! You're not planning to die, are you?!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.700
What? You were still alive?

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.240
It's the "Play Dead" plan!

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:21.700
I was planning to make the enemy relax, then I'd run away!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:26.080
But now that you said that, it's all gone to waste!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:26.920
That's what she has to say.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:33.670
Gosh, Yukimura-san. Stop kidding around.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:34.180
'Kay?

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.840
You lost my interest.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.350
Don't let your eyes off them.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:40.260
Ma'am!

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:43.350
Buou Academic School: Schoolhouse

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:45.690
Underground Research Facility

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.940
How is the evacuation of the regular students going?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:50.270
It's done, sir.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:54.950
It looks like we'll be able to keep the fear which feeds Amakusa's return to a minimum.

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:59.490
However, there is already more than enough for him to reincarnate.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:00.370
Yes, sir.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:01.910
This isn't good.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.870
Any word from Nia?

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.290
Nothing yet.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:08.380
They shouldn't be a match for her...

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.210
Fair enough.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.000
How is the analysis of the two subjects going?

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:19.140
Analysis continues on the general and samurai, but the data we're receiving from the general is very cryptic.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:20.390
And the samurai?

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.680
A decent rate.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:26.060
We should be able to gather enough data to continue the Izanami Project.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:28.400
Then leave the general for later.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.610
We don't have time.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.110
Speed up the samurai's analysis instead.

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:31.770
Yes, sir.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:37.320
I have high hopes for you, Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.240
Late night

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:40.580
Escape Plan

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:46.790
It seems as though we've been spared for now thanks to me.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.420
And that's some nice fake crying you did there.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:51.340
That was no fake crying.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.670
Just shut up and follow our lead.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:55.970
Follow?

00:05:55.970 --> 00:06:00.510
No way. You've been doing such immoral things every day that you'll rot in hell for sure.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.640
On the contrary, I alone will make it to heaven!

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:06.230
Fool, do you <i>want</i> to be executed?

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.980
I'm telling you to be prepared to run at a moment's notice.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:13.110
R-R-R-Run away?!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.240
Hey, be quiet!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.650
Yes, right away.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.570
I give, I give, give up!

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.370
Sorry for the commotion.

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:23.530
Don't do it again.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.040
Sure.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:27.750
Sheesh, you can only be so useless.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.370
Yukimura-san, I've finished my scan.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.420
There seem to be very powerful electromagnetic waves coming from these handcuffs.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:39.760
It's most likely because of those that you can't turn into a master samurai.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:43.010
So, do you think we can do something about these handcuffs?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:43.760
Yes.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:48.060
The internal structure is the same as the one we, the Committee of Discipline, were using,

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.560
so I think I can take them off.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:52.610
However, D'Artagnan's somewhere in this dojo.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:56.030
She's strong enough to defeat all of us combined.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.950
Calm down, I have an idea.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.700
I could have killed them.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:07.370
Then why didn't I?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.120
<i>Is Muneakira alive?</i>

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.630
<i>That's all I want. Please, tell me.</i>

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:17.210
Those passionate feelings for her general...

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:20.010
Did I sympathize with them?

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:22.890
Could they have...?

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:27.390
Mansion Prison

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:29.730
Tokugawa Sen

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:37.530
Muneakira and Jyuubei can't act, so I'm the only one who can do something about this situation.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:41.400
Yukimura, what move would you make?

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:44.120
Set up a search perimeter!

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:44.740
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:48.330
It looks like they left.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:52.160
I didn't think this escape route would come in handy again.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:54.540
What's with this room?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.340
Since that incident, we've been doing research on Jyuubei.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:03.180
This room seemed like it would serve our purposes well, so we used it as a hideout.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.840
Yes, this is it.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:10.810
Muneakira should be trapped somewhere in the academy schoolhouse.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:16.940
If we use the Committee of Discipline's emergency exit path, I believe we'd be able to infiltrate it, but...

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:19.030
The problem is what comes after that.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:19.980
Yeah.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:25.910
Since you three are here, this must be hell!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:26.570
The annoying one wakes up again.

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:27.580
No way, God!
The annoying one wakes up again.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:28.530
I have absolutely no connection with these evil people!

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.950
Matabei-san, the usual treatment again if you will.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:31.910
Sure.
I have absolutely no connection with these evil people!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:32.580
I have absolutely no connection with these evil people!

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:37.750
Please, don't! I don't want to fall unconscious even now when I'm a ghost!

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.130
What did you just say?

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:43.340
I said I don't want to fall unconscious-

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:46.890
Fool, I'm not asking that.

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.970
She has legs even though she's a ghost!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:49.930
Which must mean you're all zombies!

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:52.180
I see. A spiritual form.
Which must mean you're all zombies!

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.770
What is it, Yukimura-san?

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:56.400
Let's try waveform clairvoyance.

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.560
Waveform clairvoyance?

00:08:58.560 --> 00:08:58.940
Waveform Clairvoyance
Waveform Clairvoyance

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:03.400
It's a spell I learned when Sen and I perused Yoshihiko's database.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.110
The souls of humans have a certain waveform.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:12.950
By creating a harmony with the target's waveform, they say it's possible to dive into the spirit of someone far away.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:18.040
The condition seems to be that the souls of the general and samurai are tied by a strong bond, though.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:23.510
What is it? What is that disgusting ball?!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:27.840
Prison of the Soul

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.180
Muneakira

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:35.390
Yes, that's it. Forget about everything.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.480
Sanada Yukimura, why are you here?!

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:44.860
You'd never understand that!

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.860
This is the power of love!

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:47.280
What?!

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:49.910
I'm taking Muneakira back!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.620
Muneakira.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.700
Muneakira, get a grip!

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:54.750
Muneakira!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.040
Yukimura? Why?

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.710
That's my line!

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:03.710
I come here worried and I find you being played with by that woman!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:07.470
I see. That time Gisen called me out...

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.930
What happened to me after that?

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.800
We can talk later!

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.140
Here she comes!

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.320
Muneakira!

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:27.360
Did you think you could get away from <i>me</i> ?

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:31.780
This man is my last trump card. I won't hand him over, no matter what.

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:36.000
I'd heard about her, but I didn't know she was this strong...

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.210
Play time's over.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:40.880
You're going to fall into eternal sleep too!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.750
Absolute Zero!

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.010
This is nothing-

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:47.210
What?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.130
Freeze already!

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.970
Blasting Flash!

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:56.720
Tokugawa Sen...

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:58.730
Are you all right, Yukimura?

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:00.520
Somehow.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:04.060
But what will we do? Even together...

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:05.690
We're getting out of here.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.610
Hey, wait!

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.400
So they ran.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:11.030
A wise decision.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:17.410
Running away isn't the wrong thing to do.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.620
But what about Muneakira?

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:23.130
Only Muneakira's spirit is here.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:25.130
His body is somewhere else.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.500
So we're saving his body first.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.050
Yeah.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.470
Got it!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.050
Yukimura-sama...

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.390
Are you all right, Yukimura-san?

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:40.640
Hey, say something!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.140
I got it.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.650
I know where they are keeping them.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:48.480
Buou Academic School

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:50.820
Underground Research Facility

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.160
D'Artagnan

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.200
You let the guys at Yagyuu Dojo get away?

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.870
I'm sorry.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:01.040
Then why did you come back?

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.370
They should come here.

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.920
Here? Why?

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.800
To rescue Yagyuu Muneakira and the others.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:14.180
They aren't so stupid as to run in here with so few people.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.890
They will definitely come here.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:18.600
To rescue their master, no matter what the cost may be.

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.930
I don't think so...

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:21.060
<b>Alert
I don't think so...</b>

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:22.600
<b>Alert</b>

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.690
<b>Alert
What is it?</b>

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.230
There are invaders in the schoolhouse.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:29.280
They appear to be the escapees from Yagyuu Dojo.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:32.150
Wow, they really came.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.030
Whatever.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:37.570
It's not like they can do anything.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.000
All right, let's go!

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.090
There should be stairs leading underground somewhere around here.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:52.550
Do we have time to be looking for that?

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:56.800
Impressive.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.510
Good thinking.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:01.470
What's with you, going all-out all of a sudden?

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.770
I just want to finish this quickly.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:11.070
They're here.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.250
Ohii-sama, we're here to save y-

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.370
YOU'RE LATE!

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.790
It took you long enough.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:31.340
It's because we got terribly lost along the way.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.340
I bet it's your fault.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.970
You just got rescued; stop talking back to me!

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:40.550
If I weren't here, we would've been even <i>slower</i> !

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:43.600
You compulsive liar, I know you're useless!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.890
Well, at least you're safe and sound.

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:47.690
Yeah.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:49.100
Same for you.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:53.070
There's an elevator leading to the bottom floor ahead.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.940
We can make our way to Muneakira and Jyuubei if we get on it.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:58.160
Yes. Let's hurry.

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:00.240
We're going, Hanzou!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:00.870
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:03.410
Come now, Kanetsugu-san. Let's go.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.710
What are you doing, Matabei? Move it!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.250
Coming!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:10.880
Hurry!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:15.050
Th-This entrance is way too small!

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.130
There they are!

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.340
This way!

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:19.300
Matabei?

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:23.260
Yukimura-sama, everyone, please make haste and get to Muneakira-san.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.850
I'll stop them here.

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:26.730
But-

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:28.190
Please hurry!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.690
Hey! I still haven't-

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:35.230
Don't die, Matabei. Kanetsugu.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.200
Me too?!

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.700
Here we go, Kanetsugu-san.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:43.740
Argh, to hell with it!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.160
Time to go wild!

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:46.700
Yeah!

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:55.210
What's happening?

00:14:58.470 --> 00:14:59.380
Does this thing have to break when we're in such a hurry?

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:00.880
I sense something...
Does this thing have to break when we're in such a hurry?

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:03.680
If it's just a malfunction it's not so bad, but in this case...

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:04.180
I knew it.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:09.940
Ohii-sama, Yukimura-san, please continue from the adjacent shaft.

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.270
What are you saying?

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:13.360
Hurry, there isn't much time!

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:20.110
The Student Council's Armed Committee of Discipline!

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:22.660
It seems like the time has come to settle things once and for all.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:23.120
Hanzou...

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.330
Listen. If you die, I'm not going to forgive you!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.200
I know.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.870
Let's go, Sen.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:35.420
Ohii-sama, please stay safe.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:40.590
I don't want to exchange blows with my former comrades, but...

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.340
I won't go easy on you!

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:44.760
Amazing! This is amazing!

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:49.560
If I duplicate this master samurai's qualities and plant them in our samples,

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:53.440
I can finally mass produce the ultimate master samurai!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:58.480
Wow, I didn't think they'd make it here.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.110
Startup

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:12.960
Muneakira! It's me, Yukimura!

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:16.170
It seems like he's still trapped by Gisen's spell.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.380
What should we do?

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:23.970
Sen!

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:25.260
I knew it.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:28.060
I knew you'd come here.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.310
Mode: Glace!

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.690
Ice Fang!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.570
Y-Yukimura!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:40.980
Sen!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.990
You disappoint me.

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.240
Onii-sama!

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:45.820
Tokugawa Yoshihiko...

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:48.660
I'll give you one more chance.

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:53.580
If you cooperate with my plan, I can save you all.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:58.250
I have no plans of cooperating with such unethical actions!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.630
You truly disappoint me.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.420
Finish her, Nia.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:08.390
Didn't you hear me?

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:09.510
I refuse.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.140
I'm surprised.

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.940
Nia knows how to defy me.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.110
This is an order!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.530
Terminate those in front of you immediately!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.530
I... won't!

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:28.070
D'Artagnan...

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.290
A true samurai...

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:40.540
always cares for her general's safety, and will not hesitate to run into danger's path for their sake...!

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:43.670
She believes in him from her heart, and...

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.130
What are you saying, Nia?

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:49.640
And, from the bottom of her heart...!

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.100
D'Artagnan...

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.060
Just kill them already!

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:56.390
Samurai should just keep their mouth shut and listen to their master!

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:58.940
Samurai are the shields protecting the masters!

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.060
Samurai do not need their own will!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.570
Onii-sama!

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:08.820
I now understand why no more master samurai are coming into existence in Great Japan.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:09.990
What?

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:14.080
It's not that there are less samurai qualified as master samurai.

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:17.750
It's that there are no longer men with the quality needed to be a general!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.290
She's right.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:24.420
Since ancient times, generals were not necessarily of the shogunate household.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:29.640
A person who has the charm and ability to lead people is the person fit to be a general.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:30.340
In other words-

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:37.060
In other words, are you telling me that man dozing off there is a true general?

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:39.190
Yes, exactly!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:44.780
This man got trapped by that woman's spell and is dormant right now, but...

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:48.400
He is honest to everyone, and does not try to fool himself into believing.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:51.570
No matter how dangerous things become, his morals do not waver.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:54.240
He has the courage to look it in the eye!

00:18:54.370 --> 00:19:00.120
However, he's very slow to realize important things for some reason.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.710
He also annoys me often.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.340
Hey, are you listening?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:07.010
We're talking to you, Muneakira!

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:11.220
You don't seem to understand it,

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.760
Tokugawa Sen
but I...

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:13.850
Sanada Yukimura
I...

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:14.300
Sanada Yukimura

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.010
Yagyuu Muneakira
am in love with...

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:16.520
Yagyuu Muneakira

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:17.640
am in love with...
Yagyuu Muneakira

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.600
you!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:24.360
Don't listen to those voices. Having a soul is just bothersome.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:28.070
If you remain here, you won't have to think-

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:29.610
Wh-What?

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:40.540
Impossible. My spell was broken?

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:46.210
I believe that the true general, Yagyuu Muneakira, will stand again!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.630
Until then, we samurai...

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:50.880
Foolish!

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.430
What about those feelings?!

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:56.140
The proof of a general is power!

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.720
The power to subdue everything!

00:19:58.720 --> 00:19:59.390
Look!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:02.190
Jyuubei!

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:08.480
With the samurai genome I extract from this subject, I'll make the ultimate master samurai army!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:12.650
<i>I</i> am the one who can save Great Japan!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:15.490
Nia, I order you by my rank of general.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:19.290
Kill everyone there! Right now!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:22.330
Yoshihiko!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.210
Nia!

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.170
Useless...

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:27.170
Unable to Control
Useless...

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:28.710
Fine!

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.140
I'll let you have a taste of the maximum output.

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:43.640
Dance, dance!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.620
Jyuubei!

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.090
Muneakira...

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:13.010
Yagyuu... Muneakira?

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.430
Onii-chan?

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.850
Jyuubei.

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:14.880
So what <i>is</i> the relationship between you and D'Artagnan, Yoshihiko-sama?

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:17.010
Let's see, I guess you could call her my lover.

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:18.380
In French, l'amant.

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:20.380
Absolutely not. I am a knight.

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:21.720
That's what she says...

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:23.090
Nia gets embarrassed easily.

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:24.100
What you'd call a tsundere.

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:25.890
Whenever I act a little cold with her she-

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:27.310
Wait, ow, ow ow ow.

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:29.430
Poking me with that sword actually hurts, Nia.

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:30.440
Look, I'm bleeding.

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.060
Ow, ow, ow ow!

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:34.900
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran: The Samurai Who Came From France

00:23:34.900 --> 00:23:36.480
Nia, I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:39.570
I'll apologize. I-I'll apologize, so don't stab me!
